{"availability":"available","full":"NatLabRockies/R2X","name":"R2X","description":"Model translation framework","category":"Developer tools","language":"Python","stars":16,"forks":15,"created":"2024-06-20T14:46:06Z","updated":"2026-10-18T00:16:24Z","license":"BSD-3-Clause","branch":"main","homepage":"https://natlabrockies.github.io/R2X/","topics":[],"demo":"https://natlabrockies.github.io/R2X/","color":"#193546","ink":"#a6d6e8","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-18T11:30:03.014Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-18T11:30:03.014Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-18T11:30:03.014Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-09T03:37:49.933Z","stars":16,"forks":15},{"at":"2026-10-12T06:28:04.312Z","stars":16,"forks":15},{"at":"2026-10-18T11:30:03.014Z","stars":16,"forks":15}],"technologies":["Python"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["This repo houses the translation plugins for the r2x ecosystem. The r2x-cli is the orchestrator for all r2x plugins — parsers, transforms, translations, and exporters. It discovers installed plugins, chains them into pipelines, and manages Python environments.","The plugins in this repo handle the translation step: converting a parsed source system into a target format. They sit between parsers (like reeds-parser or sienna-parser) and exporters (like plexos-parser or sienna-exporter), all of which are separate packages the CLI can chain together.","Translations are driven by declarative JSON rules that map source components to target components, with @getter-decorated functions handling any derived values."],"features":[],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/NatLabRockies/R2X/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"32a328a0644c1ad119356aa2a3af6fad2c10560a9803ab287421bffc55d736be","extractedAt":"2026-10-09T03:37:50.132Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-09T03:37:50.132Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"This repo houses the translation plugins for the r2x ecosystem. The r2x-cli is the orchestrator for all r2x plugins — parsers, transforms, translation